{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":114,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਪਸਾਹ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਜਦ ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਮਿਸਰ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਨਿੱਕਲਿਆ, ਯਾਕੂਬ ਦਾ ਘਰਾਣਾ ਇੱਕ ਓਪਰੀ ਬੋਲੀ ਦੇ ਲੋਕਾਂ ਤੋਂ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤਾਂ ਯਹੂਦਾਹ ਉਹ ਦਾ ਪਵਿੱਤਰ ਸਥਾਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਉਹ ਦਾ ਰਾਜ ਹੋਇਆ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਨੇ ਡਿੱਠਾ ਤੇ ਨੱਠਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਰਦਨ ਉਲਟੀ ਵਗੀ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰਬਤ ਛੱਤ੍ਰਿਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਟੱਪਦੇ ਸਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਹਾੜੀਆਂ ਲੇਲਿਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ, ਤੈਨੂੰ ਕੀ ਹੋਇਆ ਕਿ ਤੂੰ ਨੱਠਦਾ ਹੈਂ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੂੰ, ਯਰਦਨ, ਕਿਉਂ ਉਲਟੀ ਵਗਦੀ ਹੈਂ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਪਹਾੜੋ, ਤੁਸੀਂ ਛੱਤ੍ਰਿਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਪਹਾੜੀਓ, ਤੁਸੀਂ ਲੇਲਿਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਕਿਉਂ ਟੱਪਦੇ ਹੋ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਧਰਤੀ, ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਦੇ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਾਕੂਬ ਦੇ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੇ ਸਨਮੁਖ ਕੰਬ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਚੱਟਾਨ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਣੀ ਦਾ ਛੰਭ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਚਕਮਕ ਦੇ ਪੱਥਰ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਣੀ ਦਾ ਚਸ਼ਮਾ ਬਣਾ ਛੱਡਿਆ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}